---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Atanas Delevski and this portfolio."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Atanas Delevski</h1>
    <p>
      I am a quantitative developer based in Chicago. I build small,
      evidence-driven tools for optimization, analysis, and practical decisions.
    </p>
    <p>
      I prefer explicit assumptions, measurable behavior, minimal
      infrastructure, and honest boundaries between what works, what is being
      tested, and what remains an idea.
    </p>
    <p>
      Repositories hold the code and current technical record. This site
      explains the problems, decisions, tradeoffs, and results that benefit from
      a narrative rather than another README.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
